    ],
    "text": "2AI fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2018'04'04PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 04.04.2018",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabld,Bold",
      "FMAbhaya",
      "TimesNewRoman",
