    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      73.39,
      114.73,
      541.91,
      137.2
    ],
    "text": "(a)The following Individuals are entitled to submit nominations other than themselves for appointment to the Panelof a particular Mediation Board area:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      107.83,
      148.93,
      541.91,
      182.8
    ],
    "text": "(i) A Public Officer or a Provincial Public Officer serving as the Head of a Department or as the Regional Headof a Department in an office located within the Administrative District at which that particular MediationBoard area is situated:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      107.83,
      194.53,
      523.47,
      205.6
    ],
    "text": "(ii) A Head of a Place or religious worship or of school situated in that particular Mediation Board area;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      107.83,
      217.33,
      521.87,
      228.4
    ],
    "text": "(iii) A retired Head of a Department or School principal residing in that particular Mediation Board area;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      107.83,
      240.13,
      253.29,
      251.2
    ],
    "text": "(iv) Chairman of Panel of Mediators.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      65.83,
      262.93,
      541.98,
      285.4
    ],
    "text": "(b) The following Bodies, Organizations and Institutions of Non-political nature are entitled to submit nominations forappointment to the Panel of Mediators of any Mediation Board area:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      106.39,
      297.13,
      541.95,
      319.6
    ],
    "text": "(i)Any board, Organizations or Institution which has been in existence at least for a period of five years andwhich is engaged in carrying out or doing anyone or more of the under mentioned objectives;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      119.83,
      331.33,
      460.35,
      410.8
    ],
    "text": "(a) The enhancement of educational, religious, moral or spiritual, advancement ofthe community.(b) The enhancement of social welfare and eradication of poverty.(c) The enhancement of rural or community development.(d) The enhancement of culture of sports.(e) The enhancement of projects, programmes and activities intending providing andsupplying basic needs of the peoples such as health, food and shelter etc.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      65.83,
      422.53,
      536.21,
      445.0
    ],
    "text": "(c) The following District Secretaries/Divisional Secretaries are entitled to submit nominations for appointment to thePanel of a particular Mediation Board Area:-",
    "fonts": [
      "IskoolaPota",
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      110.83,
      456.73,
      528.76,
      467.8
    ],
    "text": "(i) The District Secretaries of the Administrative District in which that Mediation Board area is situated;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      110.83,
      479.53,
      541.93,
      502.0
    ],
    "text": "(ii) As the Following Persons are entitled to be appointed to the Panel of a particular Mediation Board Area whose names may be so submitted for appointment.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      119.83,
      513.73,
      519.58,
      524.8
    ],
    "text": "(a) any person being a resident in Mediation Board Area and engaged in any work in that Area;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      119.83,
      536.53,
      541.95,
      559.0
    ],
    "text": "(b) Any person resident or engaged in any work outside that Mediation Board Area, However theCommission is of the opinion that such particular person is eligible in exceptional circumstances; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      119.83,
      570.73,
      541.92,
      604.6
    ],
    "text": "(c) Any Public Officer nominated under this paragraph by the District Secretary of the AdministrativeDistrict within which that Mediation Board is situated is eligible for appointment to the Panel ofMediators of every Mediation Board area within that Administrative District;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      119.83,
      616.33,
      541.86,
      638.8
    ],
    "text": "(d) The present Chairman, Mediators of Panels of Mediators who are due to vacate post upon thecompletion of three years.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      83.83,
      650.53,
      541.97,
      673.0
    ],
    "text": "(e)Fulfilling of Minimum requirement as G.C.E. (O/L) is being compulsory for the new nominees otherthen the members those who holding membership of Mediation Boards already.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      65.83,
      684.73,
      541.96,
      718.6
    ],
    "text": "03. (a) Individual and Boards, Organizations and Institutions referred to in Paragraph (02) above may submit nominationsof such Public Officers as are specified in Paragraph 2(a) and 2(b) above. An individual may not nominate his or hername for nominations.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      110.83,
      730.33,
      541.9,
      752.8
    ],
    "text": "(b) District Secretary referred to in Paragraph 2(c) above may submit nominations of Public Officers, of whomnot more than five may be appointed by the Commission to the relevant Panel of Mediators.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      73.89,
      85.09,
      546.57,
      109.41
    ],
