      73.17,
      120.37,
      176.61,
      131.44
    ],
    "text": "04. Form of Nominations:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      115.17,
      150.97,
      418.22,
      162.04
    ],
    "text": "(a) Individuals should submit nominations substantially in Form (a) below;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      115.17,
      181.57,
      547.23,
      192.64
    ],
    "text": "(b) Boards, Organizations and Institutions should submit nominations substantially in Form (b) below; and.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      115.17,
      212.17,
      547.29,
      223.24
    ],
    "text": "(c) District Secretaries, Divisional Secretaries should submit nominations substantially in Form (c) below;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      73.17,
      242.77,
      547.2,
      253.84
    ],
    "text": "Each nomination should be in a separate form and should without fail contain the recommendation of the nominator as",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      73.17,
      258.01,
      199.9,
      269.08
    ],
    "text": "indicated in the next paragraph.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      73.17,
      288.61,
      547.21,
      299.68
    ],
    "text": "05. The recommendation of the nominator should not be a recommendation without reasons being assigned. It",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      97.17,
      303.97,
      547.26,
      315.04
    ],
    "text": "required to set out specific facts and circumstances to enable the Commission to draw its own reference to the",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      97.17,
      319.21,
      547.24,
      330.28
    ],
    "text": "suitability or otherwise of the person nominated for appointment to the Panel of Mediators, such as, for instance,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      97.17,
      334.57,
      547.1,
      345.64
    ],
    "text": "his or her present or past occupation, the period of service or engagement in such occupations, any position or",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      97.17,
      349.81,
      547.15,
      360.88
    ],
    "text": "trust or responsibility held by him or her and the office, if any, held by him or her in any social service/ religious/",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      97.17,
      365.17,
      262.18,
      376.24
    ],
    "text": "charitable Organization, Society or Body.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      73.17,
      395.77,
      547.17,
      406.84
    ],
    "text": "06. An individual or a Body, Organizations or Institution should as far as possible, refrain from making more than three",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      97.17,
      411.01,
      547.14,
      422.08
    ],
    "text": "nominations in respect of the same Mediation Board Area. However, this limitation will not apply to the present",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      97.17,
      426.37,
      472.92,
      437.44
    ],
    "text": "Chairman of the Panel of Mediators and to the District Secretaries, and Divisional Secretaries.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      73.17,
      456.97,
      547.27,
      468.04
    ],
    "text": "07. All nominations should be forwarded to reach the Secretary, Mediation Board Commissions, No: 80, Ministry Of",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      97.17,
      472.21,
      547.12,
      483.28
    ],
    "text": "Justice\u2019s New Building, Courts Rd, Colombo 12. Before 03 months Of Period from the Date That Vacate It\u2019s",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      97.17,
      487.57,
      288.33,
      498.64
    ],
    "text": "Stipulated duration By Each Mediation Boards.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      73.17,
      518.17,
      547.22,
      529.24
    ],
    "text": "08. The Mediation Boards Commission will, based on the basic qualifications to be checked at interview, select eligible",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
